  "body": "The generic-to-algebraic specialization route does not settle Bigelow's faithful-representation question. This package records the exact source, restriction of scalars from algebraic to rational coefficients, an explicit example in which every algebraic specialization loses faithfulness, and the corrected rational representation for three strands.\n\nThe full target remains unresolved for n \u2265 4. No novelty or general nonexistence claim is made. Independent adversarial review passed for this partial scope. The author verification receipt reproduced exactly, and 35 additional exact matrix checks passed.\n\nAll changes are confined to the problem's attempt directory, including the frozen note, source provenance, research log, checks and independent review.\n",
